nough that weaker pairs (Jacks, 9s) might call, but large enough to extract value. If my opponent had a strong hand (trips, two pair, or better), they would have raised at some point. Their consistent calling suggests a medium-strength hand that's hoping I'm bluffing. I'll bet 600 to extract value while managing risk.\n\nAnswer: 600"}
